  "_pluralsDoc": "espeak sometimes clips the ending of plurals in -ies (copies comes out kˈɑːpɪz). A narration word ending in -ies must be a lexicon term or listed in pluralsChecked: check it with tools/pronounce.py --phonemes, add a term with ipa ending in iz if it ends in ɪz, otherwise add it here.",
